// Where the app looks for the BFF.
//
// The committed default is the deployed address (bff/README.md, ADR-0010). The
// generated segment belongs to the Container Apps environment and is stable for
// its life, so it is safe to commit; it changes only if that environment is
// recreated. To point a build somewhere else — a BFF on your own machine, say —
// override this in Local.xcconfig (gitignored); Local.xcconfig.example carries
// the line to copy.
//
// The value reaches the app as the BFFBaseURL key of its Info.plist —
// Info.plist next to this file substitutes it — which is where LogoApi reads it.
//
// SLASH exists because an xcconfig treats // as the start of a comment wherever
// it appears, so a URL's scheme cannot be written literally.

SLASH = /

BFF_BASE_URL = https:$(SLASH)$(SLASH)season42-bff.livelyocean-b2b153fc.norwayeast.azurecontainerapps.io
